    "detailed_description": "Warning: 2 gamepads are required to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the city of NeoFuturistTown anarchy reigns.<br />\r\nThe big barons of the underworld have taken control of the city and have been fighting for many years over the territories through internal wars.<br />\r\nTo put an end to these confrontations in the middle of the street, a brilliant inventor proposed to settle the conflicts by triad ball matches. A sport created by this man of science. To do this, he created impulse suits that attracted opponents and allowed them to propel themselves on balls of energy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe goal of the game was to score 5 goals to the opposing camp to win the conflict. Since that day, no more confrontations took place in the street...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn triad ball, a student game,  the players compete in 1 vs 1 in side view<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You must score 5 goals to win the game.<br />\r\n- Players can propel themselves on the energy balls present on the field and attract their opponents.<br />\r\n- Hit the ball to change its direction<br />\r\n- Teleport to get back to the cages<br />\r\n- Jump and double jump and move around the field <br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Students Game)",
    "about_the_game": "Warning: 2 gamepads are required to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the city of NeoFuturistTown anarchy reigns.<br />\r\nThe big barons of the underworld have taken control of the city and have been fighting for many years over the territories through internal wars.<br />\r\nTo put an end to these confrontations in the middle of the street, a brilliant inventor proposed to settle the conflicts by triad ball matches. A sport created by this man of science. To do this, he created impulse suits that attracted opponents and allowed them to propel themselves on balls of energy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe goal of the game was to score 5 goals to the opposing camp to win the conflict. Since that day, no more confrontations took place in the street...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn triad ball, a student game,  the players compete in 1 vs 1 in side view<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You must score 5 goals to win the game.<br />\r\n- Players can propel themselves on the energy balls present on the field and attract their opponents.<br />\r\n- Hit the ball to change its direction<br />\r\n- Teleport to get back to the cages<br />\r\n- Jump and double jump and move around the field <br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Students Game)",
